Many unfortunate and unlikely events are possible in this game.  They 
can't all be guarded against, especially not with just a few wishes.  The 
trick is to be prepared for the more probable and dangerous events.

Surely there is a sack somewhere in the OP's dungeon.

But if, somehow, the BOH gets cursed, the solution is simple:
1. (optional) Gate to the stash level with the Eye.
2. Drop BOH.
3. (optional) Kill nearby enemies.
4. Drop most other items (not the Eye).
5. Loot BOH, getting the more important items first.
6. Repeat 4 and 5 until the BOH is light enough to lift.
7. Pick it up and uncurse it.

Each item contained in the BOH has a less than 8% chance of vanishing, 
which is acceptable.

[1] But if you take weight into account, quite a lot of items have 
negative utility.

